          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Activity 10.5: Let us analyse"
            }
          ],
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 3,
          "bbox": [
            0.254,
            0.117,
            0.616,
            0.137
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Let us solve an interesting puzzle."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 4,
          "bbox": [
            0.254,
            0.137,
            0.882,
            0.179
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "How will you decide which stage (larva or pupa) comes immediately after the egg stage?"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 5,
          "bbox": [
            0.253,
            0.179,
            0.883,
            0.239
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Suppose you are given a container with water from a puddle containing larvae and pupae. Design an activity to find out the correct sequence of these stages."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 6,
          "bbox": [
            0.126,
            0.262,
            0.239,
            0.282
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "My design ..."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "index": 7,
          "bbox": [
            0.094,
            0.243,
            0.242,
            0.424
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "image_body",
              "index": 7,
              "bbox": [
                0.094,
                0.243,
                0.242,
                0.424
              ],
              "image_path": "images/page_15_image_7.jpg",
              "content": ""
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 8,
          "bbox": [
            0.254,
            0.239,
            0.883,
            0.281
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "You can take help of the following activity designed by Avadhi to "
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "create",
              "styles": [
                "bold"
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " your own activity—"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 9,
          "bbox": [
            0.254,
            0.281,
            0.882,
            0.32
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Step 1: I have a water container with mosquito larvae and pupae."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 10,
          "bbox": [
            0.254,
            0.321,
            0.882,
            0.362
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Step 2: I will separate 4–5 larvae and pupae into two separate containers with the same water."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 11,
          "bbox": [
            0.254,
            0.362,
            0.882,
            0.403
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Step 3: I will observe them every day until I see them changing to the next stage."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 12,
          "bbox": [
            0.254,
            0.403,
            0.883,
            0.463
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Step 4: If the larvae change into pupae, it would mean that the larval stage comes before the pupal stage or vice-versa."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 13,
          "bbox": [
            0.254,
            0.464,
            0.882,
            0.505
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Step 5: I will keep watching both the containers to see in which one a mosquito appears first."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 14,
          "bbox": [
            0.254,
            0.505,
            0.883,
            0.546
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "These observations will help us to learn the correct sequence of growth."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 15,
          "bbox": [
            0.253,
            0.546,
            0.884,
            0.649
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Now, suppose you are given a container filled with water from a puddle which contains larvae and pupae. Without separating them from the container, how would you design an activity to decide which stage, out of the two, gives way to the next?"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
